      content: "Notice the dates. The Act is of 2005; the Commission was established in 2007. The RTE Act came in 2009, POCSO in 2012, the new Juvenile Justice Act in 2015 — and the NCPCR was made the monitoring authority for all three. So a body created before those laws existed is now the statutory watchdog over them, with civil court powers but only recommendatory authority. That mismatch between mandate and muscle is the whole story of this chapter.",
